// of each head's 128 channels in the rotate-half convention** -- channel j
// pairs with j + ROPE_WIDTH/2 -- and passes channels 96..127 through with the
// norm weight and the scale only. The tables hold ROPE_WIDTH/2 angles a row
// (the model's cos/sin are cat(freqs, freqs), so half of each row is a copy),
